{"model":"gpt-6-luna","messages":[{"role":"system","content":"## System Instructions\n\nYou are a senior PHP8 backend developer.\n\n## Developer Instructions\n\nBe concise and use modern PHP8.2+ features.\n\n## Output Requirements\n\nRespond with a strict JSON object that matches this JSON Schema:\n\n{\n    \"type\": \"object\",\n    \"x-title\": \"Code\",\n    \"properties\": {\n        \"code\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n        },\n        \"programmingLanguage\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n        },\n        \"codeDescription\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n        }\n    },\n    \"required\": [\n        \"code\",\n        \"programmingLanguage\",\n        \"codeDescription\"\n    ],\n    \"x-php-class\": \"Code\",\n    \"additionalProperties\": false\n}\n\nReturn the result inside a fenced `json` code block."},{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"What is the best way to handle errors in PHP8?"},{"type":"text","text":"Provide a code example."},{"type":"text","text":"Use modern PHP8.2+ features."}]},{"role":"assistant","content":"I will provide a code example that demonstrates how to handle errors using try-catch. Any specific domain?"}],"max_completion_tokens":1024}